@startuml seq-cache
!theme plain

title Payment History Read (Cache-Aside)

participant "Web/Mobile\nClient" as Client
participant "API Gateway\n+ BFF" as BFF
participant "Query Service" as Query
participant "Redis" as Cache
participant "Query DB" as DB

== Cache Hit ==

Client -> BFF: GET /payments?walletId=123&limit=20
BFF -> Query: GET /payments?walletId=123
Query -> Cache: GET payments:wallet:123
Cache --> Query: [payment list]
Query --> BFF: 200 OK
BFF --> Client: payment history

== Cache Miss ==

Client -> BFF: GET /payments?walletId=123&limit=20
BFF -> Query: GET /payments?walletId=123
Query -> Cache: GET payments:wallet:123
Cache --> Query: null

Query -> DB: SELECT * FROM payment_projections\nWHERE wallet_id = 123
DB --> Query: [payment list]

Query -> Cache: SET payments:wallet:123 TTL=5m
Query --> BFF: 200 OK
BFF --> Client: payment history

== Cache Fallback (Redis unavailable) ==

Client -> BFF: GET /payments?walletId=123&limit=20
BFF -> Query: GET /payments?walletId=123
Query -> Cache: GET payments:wallet:123
Cache --> Query: connection error

Query -> DB: SELECT * FROM payment_projections\nWHERE wallet_id = 123
DB --> Query: [payment list]
note right of Query: Skip cache write,\nserve from DB
Query --> BFF: 200 OK
BFF --> Client: payment history

@enduml
